  "loi_giai": "$A + B - C = (xyz + 2x^2y^2 + 6xy + 4z) + (x^2y^2 - 15xy + y^2 + z) - (2xyz + x^2 - 3x^2y^2 + z^2)$\n$= xyz + 2x^2y^2 + 6xy + 4z + x^2y^2 - 15xy + y^2 + z - 2xyz - x^2 + 3x^2y^2 - z^2$\n$= (2x^2y^2 + x^2y^2 + 3x^2y^2) + (xyz - 2xyz) + (6xy - 15xy) + y^2 - x^2 + (4z + z) - z^2$\n$= 6x^2y^2 - xyz - 9xy + y^2 - x^2 + 5z - z^2$"
 },
 {
