  "de": "Cho $a+b+c=4$; $ab+bc+ca=5$, $abc=2$. Tính $M = a^4+b^4+c^4$",
  "dap_an": "18",
  "loi_giai": "Ta có $(a+b+c)^2 = a^2+b^2+c^2+2(ab+bc+ca)$\nSuy ra $4^2 = a^2+b^2+c^2+2.5 \\Rightarrow a^2+b^2+c^2 = 6$\nTa có $(ab+bc+ca)^2 = a^2b^2+b^2c^2+c^2a^2+2abc(a+b+c)$\nSuy ra $5^2 = a^2b^2+b^2c^2+c^2a^2+2.2.4 \\Rightarrow a^2b^2+b^2c^2+c^2a^2 = 9$\nMà $(a^2+b^2+c^2)^2 = a^4+b^4+c^4+2(a^2b^2+b^2c^2+c^2a^2)$\nSuy ra $6^2 = a^4+b^4+c^4+2.9 \\Rightarrow a^4+b^4+c^4 = 18$"
 },
 {
